00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.320
this kind of notation where you can put in f...&nbsp;
little f or capital f, it actually doesn't matter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:21.760
and then you have some literal stuff and then&nbsp;
within the string you can put more python code.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.960
so this is really useful and it was introduced&nbsp;
