00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.120
but what you may not know is that there's a&nbsp;
lot of extra stuff that you can put in between&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:40.640
these curly braces to modify what actually&nbsp;
