we see string value equals and then the repr&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.960 --> 00:01:22.240
of that variable. so this is extremely useful&nbsp;
especially for debugging purposes if there's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:27.840
some variable in your code like num_value and i&nbsp;
just want to add a quick debug print statement,&nbsp;&nbsp;

